      "message": "fix(motion): open the trochoidal slot's bore on a band wider than the tool radius\n\nA helix of radius b clears only the ring b +- r. On a loop band with\nb > r (a channel wider than twice the tool), the plain bore left a post\nof radius b - r at the start, at full depth, and the operation reported\nOK. plan_trochoidal_slot now asks the lane planner for the opened bore\nfrom #1509 when b > r. Bands with b <= r keep the plain bore and post\nbyte-identically.\n\nPinned by trochoid_wide_channel_leaves_no_post_at_the_start (motion\ntrochoid_slot suite), the extended\nthe_opened_bore_leaves_no_post_at_the_lane_start and\na_slot_band_within_the_tool_radius_keeps_the_plain_bore.\n\nFixes #1589\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
